          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "verso",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>There came before us, we, the members of the court</li>\n<li>who have signed below,&nbsp;</li>\n<li>(in) a session of the court in Fustat</li>\n<li>on Tuesday, 10</li>\n<li>Tammuz 1537 of the (era of) documents,</li>\n<li>corresponding to 10 Rajab</li>\n<li>of the year six hundred twenty-three,</li>\n<li>\u301aAb\u016b l-\u1e24usayn\u301b Ab\u016b Sa\u02bf\u012bd al-Levi,</li>\n<li>son of the elder Ab\u016b l-Ma\u02bf\u0101n\u012b</li></ol>\n",
